{"4108490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Morkull Ascend to the Gods", "steam_appid": 4108490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morkull Ascend to the Gods is a 2D action video game focused on boss battles, once again taking control of the charismatic God of Death: Morkull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the original world of Morkull Ragast's Rage, locked up and aware that he is in a new video game, you must help him escape so that he can carry out his evil plans for the world and rule by subjecting everyone to his will (yes, including you).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/8719c959d0e9a3314e4495f78d54c4c1.poster.avif?t=1786472950\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/8719c959d0e9a3314e4495f78d54c4c1.webm?t=1786472950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will feel the power and bear the weight of being the God of Death and Darkness. A select series of battles against other henchmen, minions, and Gods that make up the Olympus of the Kingdom of Midaldus await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry, don't tremble. You won't be alone. You will have Morkull (or rather, he has you), who has a wide range of combos, skills, and charms that you can unlock, equip, and build to your liking before each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although you will also die a good number of times (Disaster Games is not responsible for thrown controllers, broken televisions, or possible damage caused).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/228b77b9c915526d7a1179752b6f29cf.poster.avif?t=1786472950\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/228b77b9c915526d7a1179752b6f29cf.webm?t=1786472950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/228b77b9c915526d7a1179752b6f29cf.mp4?t=1786472950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morkull is back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This means that his charisma, character, and personality, along with breaking the fourth wall, will create a lighthearted atmosphere at all times (you're going to need it), loaded with bad jokes, references, and memes that are very present in pop culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like having a friend playing alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/9e46bde0071d9570f91129560c6f02a9.poster.avif?t=1786472950\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/9e46bde0071d9570f91129560c6f02a9.webm?t=1786472950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/9e46bde0071d9570f91129560c6f02a9.mp4?t=1786472950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like its predecessor, Morkull Ascend to the Gods is completely hand-drawn and animated, with great care and frame by frame. In this way, thanks to traditional animation, the characters' movements are very natural and full of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinguished by a stylized character and a wide color palette, this time, outside of Ragast, you will be able to see and discover other environments that belong to the Kingdom of Midaldus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morkull is back! So get back in trouble with him and join his ranks by supporting his Machiavellian cause.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morkull Ascend to the Gods is a 2D action video game focused on boss battles, once again taking control of the charismatic God of Death: Morkull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the original world of Morkull Ragast's Rage, locked up and aware that he is in a new video game, you must help him escape so that he can carry out his evil plans for the world and rule by subjecting everyone to his will (yes, including you).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/8719c959d0e9a3314e4495f78d54c4c1.poster.avif?t=1786472950\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/8719c959d0e9a3314e4495f78d54c4c1.webm?t=1786472950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will feel the power and bear the weight of being the God of Death and Darkness. A select series of battles against other henchmen, minions, and Gods that make up the Olympus of the Kingdom of Midaldus await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry, don't tremble. You won't be alone. You will have Morkull (or rather, he has you), who has a wide range of combos, skills, and charms that you can unlock, equip, and build to your liking before each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although you will also die a good number of times (Disaster Games is not responsible for thrown controllers, broken televisions, or possible damage caused).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/228b77b9c915526d7a1179752b6f29cf.poster.avif?t=1786472950\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/228b77b9c915526d7a1179752b6f29cf.webm?t=1786472950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/228b77b9c915526d7a1179752b6f29cf.mp4?t=1786472950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morkull is back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This means that his charisma, character, and personality, along with breaking the fourth wall, will create a lighthearted atmosphere at all times (you're going to need it), loaded with bad jokes, references, and memes that are very present in pop culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like having a friend playing alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/9e46bde0071d9570f91129560c6f02a9.poster.avif?t=1786472950\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/9e46bde0071d9570f91129560c6f02a9.webm?t=1786472950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/extras/9e46bde0071d9570f91129560c6f02a9.mp4?t=1786472950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like its predecessor, Morkull Ascend to the Gods is completely hand-drawn and animated, with great care and frame by frame. In this way, thanks to traditional animation, the characters' movements are very natural and full of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinguished by a stylized character and a wide color palette, this time, outside of Ragast, you will be able to see and discover other environments that belong to the Kingdom of Midaldus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morkull is back! So get back in trouble with him and join his ranks by supporting his Machiavellian cause.</p>", "short_description": "Play as Morkull, God of Death and Darkness. Aware that he finds himself in a video game once again, you must help him escape so he can carry out his new plan for world domination. To do so, you must defeat an entire pantheon of gods in thrilling boss battles.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/7f4904da257d6b5e28a5bb1c7464aeded188a5ba/header.jpg?t=1786472950", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/d9428435419f39ed9ccd249a5a7fe813efa744b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786472950", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108490/d9428435419f39ed9ccd249a5a7fe813efa744b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786472950", "website": "https://x.com/DisasterGames", "pc_requi